# Fog Bank (0/2, Defender, Flying) blocks Bot2's Grizzly Bears (2/2): "Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to ... this creature"
# means the 2 damage does not destroy it (CR 615.1, 510.2). Its keywords come from its card, and Defender keeps it from attacking.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Fog Bank
Island x4
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Grizzly Bears
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fog Bank.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fog Bank.Keywords = Defender; Flying
Bot2.Attack(Grizzly Bears > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Fog Bank > Grizzly Bears)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Fog Bank.Keywords = Defender; Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Fog Bank.Damage = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Damage = 0
Bot1.Life = 20
